&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting at Executive Steering Committee meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and plans for customer meetings to get effective outcomes and ensure the customer is on track in the project plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polished English language communicator, persuasive presenter, fast on your feet, and innately organized; Superb negotiation and diplomacy skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
