&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review customer contracts and create Sales Orders in NetSuite to ensure proper revenue accounting treatment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Legal during contract negotiations to flag non-standard terms, discounting issues, or revenue recognition risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure complex sales orders and milestones are accurately billed; prepare, review, and distribute customer billing with a service-oriented approach to client inquiries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and reconcile deferred revenue, unbilled AR, and commission accrual journal entries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review daily transactions related to receivables and customer deposits for accuracy and timeliness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Record and review general ledger journal entries; support GL integrity through consistent reconciliation and review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support payroll data alignment between HR and Accounting for multi-country compensation processing (data validation, not ownership of payroll compliance).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team planning, recommend cost-control opportunities, and support ad hoc accounting projects.&lt;/li&gt;
