&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting or a closely related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years of accounting experience at a global, US-HQ&#39;d company, with demonstrated strength in general ledger, journal entries, and month-end close.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of US GAAP, accrual accounting, and revenue recognition principles (ASC 606 exposure a plus).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with NetSuite required;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills; able to manage competing priorities independently and cross-functionally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
